# Fragment: append to the repository's .gitattributes, after `* text=auto eol=lf`.

# Visual Studio rewrites a .sln with CRLF line endings: keep them, or every save
# shows a whole-file diff. (.slnx is XML and keeps LF.)
*.sln text eol=crlf

# Binary artifacts that may be committed as test data
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.nupkg binary
*.snupkg binary
